  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Meet Me At The Creek** (1 review): Track 9 is a medley of Ernest T. Grass going into Paul & Silas [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Jack A Roe**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 4 archived performances; with Marrage Proposal [3]\n- **Roll In My Sweet Babys Arms**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BillyStrings2018-07-19.Catskill.MilabVM-44Link.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 13 songs; 90 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Marrage Proposal [1]\n- Stage talk about: crowd / thanks [1]\n- Microphones were placed in AB configuration at the left stack, about 3 feet back and roughly 7 feet high [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BillyStrings2018-07-19.Catskill.MilabVM-44Link.flac16**: taped by Seth Nochajski & Keith Januszak; transferred by Seth Nochajski; source: Milab VM-44 Links > Naiant Littlebox > Sony PCM-M10 [24/48] [1]. Also: Transfer went from MicroSD to PC, then Sound Forge Pro 11, dithered to 16-bit and resampled to 44.1 kHz, then FLAC16 [1]",
